<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Argentine</p>
<p>soccer championship matches played at the weekend.</p>
<p> River Plate	  3    Boca Juniors	  3</p>
<p> Colon		  3    Estudiantes	   1</p>
<p> Lanus		  1    Gimnasia-Jujuy	1</p>
<p> Huracan Corrientes 1    Platense		1</p>
